Technical Notes
Data Modeling
Source datasets were integrated using shared identifiers such as:
Store
Date
Department where applicable
SQL Layer
SQL was used as the transformation and analytical layer before Tableau reporting.
Reusable SQL views were created to provide a consistent analytical source for dashboard development.
Tableau Layer
Tableau was connected to the prepared analytical dataset for:
KPI reporting
Trend analysis
Seasonality analysis
Store and department comparisons
Driver analysis
Forecasting
Reproducibility
Because the original source data may be subject to redistribution restrictions, raw files are not included in this repository by default.
The SQL scripts document the analytical workflow and should be aligned with the locally loaded source tables.
